A selected malformed macro-body request reports its expansion path and keeps
already emitted text. The .nr side effect before the error is retained.
-- input.roff --
prefix
.de BROKEN
.nr X 9
.TH
..
.BROKEN
suffix
-- error.txt --
parse expansion
-- expected.txt --
groff.TokenText "prefix"
register X=9
error evaluate token 2 (macro BROKEN / body line 2): parse expansion: fitting TokenMacroTH arguments: , missing required argument 1
